## RelationType: 分类

来源 IRI：`https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/construct/categorizes`。来源定义：relation between classifiers in which a higher-order classifier classifies a lower-order classifier and designates a set that has as members only sets designated by lower-order classifiers that it organizes。此 BKN 投影使用 `categorizes_target_id` 保存目标实体 ID。

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
|--------|--------|------|
| classifier | classifier | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
|-----------------|-----------------|
| categorizes_target_id | entity_id |
